      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Will be interesting to see how Glory Mission goes in the previous race as he smashed many of these last time, including OZONICA (1). Won by five fresh then a four length third behind Glory Mission last time. Fitter again and will find this easier. Expected to bounce back. BENEFITSOFMINE (2) is racing well with wins at two of last three, including a last start course and distance win at first try this circuit. Can measure up again. SOUTHERN AURORAS (4) was a winner two back then freshened after finishing fifth last time. Better than that. OUTBUSH (9) ran a 10-length last behind Glory Mission last time but the start prior has form around SOUTHERN AURORAS. Huge weight drop here and with early speed can give a sight. WILD DANCER (3) was beaten six lengths by Glory Mission last time and with the blinkers added can do better.",
